em (which runs in POST_UPDATE) a query filter was added like this:\r\n`mut changed_parent_query: Query<(Entity, &Parent, Option<&mut PreviousParent>), Changed<Parent>,>,`\r\nChanged is reset after each frame, so the entities in question are no longer picked up in the next frame as before. I think removing Changed here does no great harm, because the system has to verify anyway that the value actually changed (Changed only tracks mutable access).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/731612498/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"svents","id":73037851,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDM3ODUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73037851?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents","html_url":"https://github.com/svents","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"svents","id":73037851,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDM3ODUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73037851?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents","html_url":"https://github.com/svents","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svents/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/